    {
      "section_id":"section_2",
      "type":"verse",
      "performer":"",
      "lines":[
        {
          "n":"0",
          "text":"You see, they probably wonder why I don't smile (Yup)",
          "rhyme":"ajl",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"1",
          "text":"'Cause these cats need to get they own style (Uh-huh)",
          "rhyme":"il",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"2",
          "text":"Hold the phone dial, I go miles (Chyeah)",
          "rhyme":"ajls",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"3",
          "text":"When I'm sprintin' on the beat, you'll get lifted off your feet",
          "rhyme":"it",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"4",
          "text":"When you spliffin' up my trees, quit givin' me a speech",
          "rhyme":"itS",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"5",
          "text":"I ain't really tryna hear this (Nah)",
          "rhyme":"i",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"6",
          "text":"See, with these lyrics, I'm tryna run fearless",
          "rhyme":"Es",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"7",
          "text":"We playin' games in this jungle, Jumanji",
          "rhyme":"i",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"8",
          "text":"With bomb tree, hidden under all my dirty laundry (Haha)",
          "rhyme":"aj",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"9",
          "text":"Call me an arm free fuckin' around",
          "rhyme":"awnd",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"10",
          "text":"I'm puttin' words in your mind 'til you in love with the sound (Come on, man)",
          "rhyme":"awnd",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"11",
          "text":"They savin' my place, tryna shove this food in my face",
          "rhyme":"as",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"12",
          "text":"So they force it down my throat 'til I'm used to the taste",
          "rhyme":"ast",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"13",
          "text":"Now move to your place (Yup), 'cause I'm campin' out on top",
          "rhyme":"Op",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"14",
          "text":"Fresh kicks on my feet while you sittin' in some socks (Haha)",
          "rhyme":"Ok",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"15",
          "text":"Cops tryna get me locked, catch me fuckin' with shenanigans (Fuck 'em)",
          "rhyme":"#",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"16",
          "text":"But I'll just handle 'em and throw 'em in the ambulance (Bitch)",
          "rhyme":"#s",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"17",
          "text":"They wanna know what my hands is in, scare me straight (Huh?)",
          "rhyme":"Et",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"18",
          "text":"Get back, bitch, I ain't tryna share my plate (You know)",
          "rhyme":"at",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"19",
          "text":"What's good, fam? I love money, I will marry cake",
          "rhyme":"Ek",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"20",
          "text":"Get a rich bitch like Ashley and Mary Kate",
          "rhyme":"Ejt",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"21",
          "text":"And I ain't talkin' 'bout one of 'em (Nope), I'm gettin' both (Yup)",
          "rhyme":"o",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"22",
          "text":"I grab 'em, get a loaf, then take their money and they coats (Give me that)",
          "rhyme":"Owt",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"23",
          "text":"I blow trees, so my mouth is always filled with smoke",
          "rhyme":"ok",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"24",
          "text":"You sniffin' coke, singin' but you haven't hit a note (Ah)",
          "rhyme":"Ot",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"25",
          "text":"Plus that shit you wrote isn't set to carry a crowd",
          "rhyme":"aR",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"26",
          "text":"I'm legendary anywhere that I'm out (They know)",
          "rhyme":"awt",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"27",
          "text":"I'm sharin' this pound with my people like a How High sequel",
          "rhyme":"El",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"28",
          "text":"Told my people, \"Need to air out the house\" (Oof)",
          "rhyme":"awz",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"29",
          "text":"So beware of my mouth, spittin' venom, comin' out the cerebellum",
          "rhyme":"Om",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"30",
          "text":"With these kicks on my feet, see, I told you I was gellin' (Yes sir)",
          "rhyme":")",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"31",
          "text":"You playin' felon, you in stealin' a penny",
          "rhyme":"i",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"32",
          "text":"I put a hole in your belly like you Oprah or Jenny (Chyeah)",
          "rhyme":"i",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        }
      ],
