        },
        {
          "n":"2",
          "text":"Some people do it for the love, some people do it 'cause they can",
          "rhyme":"#",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"3",
          "text":"But me, I'm tryna be a legend like Bagger Vance (Yes sir)",
          "rhyme":"#s",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"4",
          "text":"Some rap will make you think, while other shit'll make you dance",
          "rhyme":"#s",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"5",
          "text":"So I bump whatever's in the system, try and make some plans",
