        },
        {
          "n":"6",
          "text":"(Ayo, what's good, dog?)",
          "rhyme":null,
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"7",
          "text":"I just wanna see what's good for the night time",
          "rhyme":"ajm",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"8",
          "text":"If nothing's hype, I'ma head up to the crib and write rhymes",
          "rhyme":"im",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"9",
          "text":"Age like white wine, nicer by the second (So nice)",
          "rhyme":"$",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"10",
          "text":"That's why I never put punctuation on a sentence",
          "rhyme":"#s",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"11",
          "text":"'Cause the song goes on (Goes on), hear a dope song",
          "rhyme":"$g",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"12",
          "text":"If they said I wasn't for real, then you was told wrong",
          "rhyme":"$g",
          "persona_id":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"13",
          "text":"See, you ain't on what we on",
          "rhyme":"$",
